msgstr "Kiosco: liberar la terminal"

#. module: xpago_self_order
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/xpago_self_order/static/src/app/payment_page.js:0
msgid ""
"The card was not paid in time. The terminal is free: try again when you are "
"ready."
msgstr ""
"No se pagó con la tarjeta a tiempo. La terminal quedó libre: inténtalo de "
"nuevo cuando estés listo."

#. module: xpago_self_order
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:xpago_self_order.field_pos_config__xpago_kiosk_timeout
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:xpago_self_order.field_res_config_settings__pos_xpago_kiosk_timeout
msgid ""
"When nobody pays on the XPago terminal of the kiosk within this time, the "
"charge is cancelled and the terminal is free for the next customer. 0 never "
"cancels it."
msgstr ""
"Si nadie paga en la terminal XPago del kiosco en este tiempo, el cobro se "
"cancela y la terminal queda libre para el siguiente cliente. 0 nunca lo "
"cancela."

#. module: xpago_self_order
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:xpago_self_order.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid ""
"When the customer does not pay on the XPago terminal in time, the charge is "
"cancelled and the terminal is free for the next customer."
msgstr ""
"Si el cliente no paga a tiempo en la terminal XPago, el cobro se cancela y "
"la terminal queda libre para el siguiente cliente."
